    "text": "<blockquote><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mn>1</mn><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>The graph of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/63130d70-2975-43ab-8d93-a99f2940e5f9-image.png\" style=\"width: 287px; height: 200px;\" /></p><p>So&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>&#945;</mi></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mi>&#946;</mi></msubsup><mn>0</mn><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mn>1</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/4858d51a-cdcb-4527-8ed3-356bcc2913a3-image.png\" style=\"width: 318px; height: 200px;\" /></p><p>When&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Hence&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>37</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>13</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>37</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>13</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>37</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>13</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>37</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>13</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac></math></p></blockquote>",
